# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfiles actually need. Both images
# install their own dependencies and build from source, so local installs,
# build output, secrets and runtime data must never reach the daemon (they
# would otherwise end up in image layers via `COPY web/ ./`).

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Runtime data (SQLite DB, generated API key)
data

# Repo metadata and docs
.git
.github
docs
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
